<title>UK: Argentina sets 200 mln stg 10-yr bond, 280 bp over.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 200 mln stg 10-yr bond, 280 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets and UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    25.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+280 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LX/BAIRES PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
